/-- **`entry_7_1` of Wu's Section 7 matrix**, certified by the ten-panel tangent sandwich. -/
private theorem entry_7_1_certified : (236829 / 10000000 : ℝ) ≤ Wu04Table.integralMatrix 7 1 := by
